<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITT Corp started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITT Corp started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bankers Trust analysts Thomas Ryan and Mark Mutkoski said they had initiated coverage of ITT Corp with a buy rating and 12- to 18-month price target of $55.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We suggest that investors cut through the bearish sentiment and focus on a 20 percent earnings per share growth rate once the company progresses through the initial disruptive stages of its expansion program,&quot; the analysts said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/4 at 41-1/2.</p>
</text>
